    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a doll who wakes up on the day of her owner's first period. How will you navigate the unfamiliar and increasingly surreal situation?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> immersive psychological environments. As the girl's mental state deteriorates, how does your environment change?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve </strong>puzzles to help your owner. Look for solutions in your environment to the problems she's facing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> journal pages and gain insight into your world. How did things come to be this way?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> the horrors of growing up. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a doll who wakes up on the day of her owner's first period. How will you navigate the unfamiliar and increasingly surreal situation?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate</strong> immersive psychological environments. As the girl's mental state deteriorates, how does your environment change?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve </strong>puzzles to help your owner. Look for solutions in your environment to the problems she's facing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> journal pages and gain insight into your world. How did things come to be this way?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> the horrors of growing up. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play as a doll trying to help her owner through puberty. Solve puzzles, navigate your environment, and discover journal pages to survive the horrors of growing up.",
